<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Kolosate</book>
  <para style="h">Kolosate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolosate</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosate</para>
  <para style="mt">Kolosate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian deihdana Khrist Jesu sawltak leh i unaupa Timothi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kolossa khua a Khrist a misiangthoute leh unau muanhuaite kiang ah: Pathian i Pa kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou ading a thum gige in Pathian i Toupa Jesu Khrist Pa kiang ah kipahthu ka gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist Jesu na gindan uh leh misiangthou tengteng tung a itna na neihdan uh ka zaktak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai bel nou ading a lametna van a koihkholha a om ziak ahi. Huai lametna tanchin mah tuma in, Tanchinhoih thutak na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai Tanchinhoih tuh khovel tengteng ah gaha a khan zel mah bang in na kiang uh hongtung hi, Pathian hehpihna na ngaihkhiak ua na zak ni ua kipan in, noumau ah leng gah in a khangzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchibang in Epaphra i sikha hihpih ngaihtak lak a na zil bang un, amah kou sik in Khrist nasempa muanhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Kha a na itna uh a honhilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka zak ni ua kipan kou leng nou adia thum leh nget ka tawpkei uhi; huchi a khalam pilna leh theihna tengteng a a deihlam theihna a hihdim a na hongom theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan nasep hoih chiteng a gaha, Pathian theihna a khang a, Amah kipahlam a Toupa adia kilawm a na hin theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kipahna toh kithuah thuakhatna leh kuhkalna nei ding in, a hatna thupi bangzel a hihhat in hongom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vak a misiangthoute gouluahpih dia hon chingsak Pa kiang a kipahthu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman mial thuneihna lak a kipan hon suaktasak in, A Tapa ittak gam ah hon kaisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah ah i tatkhiakna leh khelhnate ngaihdamna i mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah muhtheihlouh Pathian batpih, thilsiam tengteng a piang masapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah ah bangkim siam ahi a, van a omte, lei a omte toh, muhtheihte, muhtheihlouhte toh, mangtutphahte, thuneihnate; bangkim amah siam ahi, amah ading maha siam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan amah zaw bangteng omma in leng a om hi, amah ah bangtenga dingkhawm chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah tuh pumpi, saptuam lutang ahi a; bangkim a tungnungpen a hong hihtheihna ding in a bulpi, misi lak a kipan a piang masapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah ah Pathian tangchinna tengteng a om Pa deihlam tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A Kros sisan a lemna na bawl in amah ah bangkim amah toh a kilemsak hi; amah ngei ah lei a thil omte leh van a thil omte leng amah toh a kilemsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan nou tuma lam in na lungsim uah a melma na hi ua, na thilhih gilou ua amah a kipan a khen a om na hi uhi, himahleh tuin aman amah toh hon kilemsakta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sihna in a pumpi ah amah toh noute a hon kilemsakta hi, a ma a siangthou, gensiatbei leh mawhsaktheihlouh a a hon dinsak theihna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kingakna nei a kiptak a om a, Tanchinhoih na zak ua lametna a kipan a suanmang a omlou a, ginna a na om gige peuhmah uleh; huai Tanchinhoih van nuai a thilsiam tengteng lak a tangkoupih ahi a; kei Paul leng huai nasem dia bawl ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou ziak a tu a ka gimthuaknate ah ka kipak hi; huan a pumpi ziak a Khrist in a gimthuaknate ban zomzel ka hi: a pumpi tuh Saptuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nou ading a Pathian nasepna kei kiang a piak a om bangzel in huai saptuam nasempa ka hong hita a, Pathian thu bukimtak a theisak ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai Pathian thu tuh tangtawn leh akhang akhanga kipan a thuguk kisel ahi; tun bel misiangthoute kiang ah latsak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau kiang ah, Jentelte lak a huai thuguk thupina hauhsakna tamdan Pathian in theihsak a ut him ahi; huai thuguk tuh Khrist noumau a om, thupina lametna pen ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Michih Khrist a hoihkim a ka piak theihna ding un michih hilh in, pilna chiteng a zilsakin, a tanchin ka gen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchibang ding in nakpitak a keimah a a sepsak thahatna tengteng zang in theihtawp in ka semzel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noumau leh Laodisia khua a omte leh sa a ka mel mulou peuhmahte ading in bangchibanga thupi in ahia nou adia ka kisuk na theih uh ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian thuguk a theihtheih ua, theihsiamna theihchetna kim hauhna tengteng lam a, phankhawma a om ua, a lungtangte uh lungmuanga a om theihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna leh theihna gou chiteng amah Khrist ah selguk in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuamah in paukamsiama a hon khemzoh louhna ding un, huaite ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sa in na kiang uah om keimah leng, kipaktak a om in na kizen dan uleh Khrist ginna a na kipdan uh thei in, kha in na kiang uah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Khrist Jesu, Toupa na kipahpih bang un, amah ah om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah a zungkai leh lamtouha om in, a hon zilsak bang un na ginna ua kiptak a om in, kipahthugenna hau in amah ah om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilvang un, huchilou in zaw kuapeuh in Khrist thu hilou, mihing thugousiah leh khovel thubulte bang in a thupil uh leh khemna peuh in gallak in a honla kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah ah Pathian tangchinna chiteng tuh sapum nei in a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah ah hinna tangchinna na neita ngal ua; amah vaihawmna leh thuneihna tengteng lutang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah ah zeksum, mihing khut a sum hilou, Khrist in a bawl zeksumna ah na pianken khelhna uh suahkhia in zeksum na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptisma a amah toh vui na hita ua, huai mah ah misi lak a kipan a Pathian nasep gintak ziak in amah toh kaihthoh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan noute na tatleknate uleh na sa uh zeksum louhna a si na hi ua, noumau ngei amah toh a hon hingsak in na talekna tengteng uh a ngaidamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I tatlekna tengteng hon ngaidama, batna lai thupiaka gelh i tung ua om eimah hondou gige a nulmangta hi. Huai ngei Kros a kilhlum in a lamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihawmna leh thuneihnate suankhia in, huaite Kros a zou in a langtang in theihsakna in a zangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in nek leh dawn thu ah hiam, Ankuanglui leh kha thak thu ah leh khawlni tan thu ah kuamah in hondem kei hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaite thil hongtung ding lim ahi a, a tak Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuamah in amau deihthu lel a thunuailutna leh angel biakna zang in, a thilmuhte uh pansan in, a salam lungsim ziak ua kisathei mawkmawk in, na kipahman uh hon suhsak kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lutang len chinten lou in a om uhi. Amah a kipan in sapum a pum in a guhtuah leh thaguite a vak leh zopkhawm a om in, Pathian khansak bangzel in a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khovel thubulte Khrist kiang a na sihsan uleh, bang achia khovel a khosa bang a thupiakte lak a na ki pelut na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lawng ken, Chiam ken, Khoih ken, chihte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihingte thuchiam leh zilsakna huchibang thil tengteng zatkawma mangthang ding hilou uhiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiai thilte bawltawm biakna leh thunuailutna taklou leh, pumpi engbawlna ah zaw hihtuak hileh a kilawm na a, himahleh sa deihlam zuih khamna ah bangmah a phatuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Khrist toh kaihthoh khawma na omtak man un, tunglam a Pathian taklam a tu Khrist omna a thil omte zong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tunglam a thil omte ah na lungsim uh nga un, lei a thil omte a ngalou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na sita ua, tuin na hinna uh Pathian ah Khrist toh selin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist i hinna uh a hong kilak chiang in nou leng amah kiang ah thupi in na kilak sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in noumau a leilam thildeihna omte that un, kingaihna, nitna, hukna, utna gilou, huaihamna; huaihamna milim biakna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai thilte ziak in Pathian thangpaihna thumanglou tate tung ah a tung nak ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou leng tuma lam a huai thilte a na nuntak lai un, huaite ah na khosa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin zaw nou leng hiai tengteng, hehna, thangpaihna, huatna, gensiatna, na kam ua pau zahmohte koihmang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zuau kihilh tuah kei un, mihing lui a thilhih toh na suahkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing thak in na kivanta ngal ua; huai mihing thak a siampa batpih bang a theihna a siamthak in a om lellel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ah Grik mi leh Judami, zeksum leh sumlouh, melmak mite, Skithia mite, sikhate, noplente leng a omkei a; Khrist bangkim hizaw in, bangkim ah a om behlap lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian mitel, misiangthou leh deihtakte bang in lainatna lungtang, migitna, kingaihniamna, thunuailutna, thuakzohna in kivan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kuapeuh in kua tung ah leng thubuai nei hile u chin, kithuakzou chiat in, kingaidam tuah unla, Toupa’n a hon ngaihdam tak bang in kingaidam tuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan huai tengteng tung ah itna silhthuah un; huai in thil bangkim kituaktakin a gakkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan Khrist khamuanna in na lungtang uah vaihawm hen, huai ding in pumpi khat a sap na hi ua, kipahna dan leng thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khrist thu a hauhna teng toh noumau ah dimsak kiihkeih un, pilna chiteng a kisinsak leh kihilh tuaha om a, kipahna lungtang toh Pathian kiang a phatna late, Pathian late, khalam late sa in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan na hih peuhmah uh thugen ah leh thilhih ah amah ziak a Pa Pathian kiang a kipahthugen kawm in Toupa Jesu min in hihvek un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zite aw, Toupa ah a kilawm hun bangzel in na pasalte uh kiang ah kingainiam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasalte aw, na zite uh it unla, a lak uah hanhat kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naupangte aw, bangkim ah na nu uleh na pate uh thumang un, huai tuh Toupa pahtak lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pate aw, na tate uh hihnuak kei un, huchilou in zaw a lunglel kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhate aw, sa a na heutute uh thu bangkim ah mang un, mihing hihkipak lelte bang a mitmei nasem hilou in, lungtang sa khat a Toupa kihta kawm in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na hih peuhmah uh, mihing ading bang hihlou in, Toupa ading zaw in kilawp tak in hih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa a kipan in a itna gouluah ding na mu ding uh chih thei in: Toupa Khrist nasem na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thil diklou hihpan a thil diklou hihman a mu nawn ding hi; mi khentuamna a om ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Heutute aw, nou leng van ah heutupa na neih uh thei in, na sikhate uh tung ah adik atang leh a kilawm hih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thum gige unla, kipahthu genkawm in kiveng gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist thuguk gen ding a Pathian in thu adia kong a hon honsak theihna ding in kou leng hon thumsak un, huai thu ziak a hen a om ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka gen ding bangtak a ka genkhiak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun na neih sung un a tam theipen semzel unla, pawlam mite lak ah piltak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michih bangchibang a dawn ding hiam chih na theihna ding un na paukamsuak uh chisoh, hehpihna hi gige hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa a unau ngaihtak, nasempa muanhuai, sikha hihpih Tukika in ka tanchin tengteng nou a hon theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiaiziakin, ka tanchin uh na theihna ding uleh, na lungtang uh a hon khamuan theihna ding in amah na kiang uah k’on sawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onesima, unau muanhuai leh gaihtak noumau lak a mi mah toh a hongding uhi. Amau hiai lam a thil omdan tengteng a hon theisak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aristarkhas, ka hentakpih pa’n nou chibai a honbuk hi. Mark, Barnaba tupa in leng, chibai a honbuk hi, amah tungtang thu ah thupiakte na mu uh; na kiang ua a hongpai leh, na kipahpih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu, Justa a chih un chibai nou a honbuk hi. Huaite zeksum mi ahi ua, huaite kia Pathian gam thu lam ah ka seppih leh a hon khamuante ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Epaphra noumau lak a mi mah, Khrist Jesu sikha in chibai nou a honbuk hi, aman Pathian deihlam phot pichin leh gingta bikbeka na din theihna ding un, a thumna ah nou ading in a kisuk gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noumau ading, Laodisia khua a omte ading leh Hierapoli khua a omte ading in phatuam a ngai mahmah chih ka theihpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luke, Daktor ngaihtak leh Dema in chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodisia khuaa unau omte leh Nympha leh a inn a saptuamte chibai honbuk sakun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan hiai laikhak na lak ua na sim nung un, Laodisia saptuamte lak ah leng simsakun; nou leng Laodisia khua a pen nana sim sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Arkippa kiang ah “Nasepna Toupa a i muhpen tangtun ding in pilvang in,” na chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei Paul in keimah khut ngeia hiai chibaibukna k’on gelh ahi. Ka kolbulhte theigige un. Hehpihna na kiang uah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
